u trying to do?","source_cn":"你们想做什么……","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:懵懂的平民小孩":{"text":"Innocent Girl","source":"懵懂的平民小孩","status":"exact_hash"}}},"faction_dailies/menus/14010536_1_3.en.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010536:1:3","lang":"en","texts":{"menu:8019740:1":{"text":"Where did she go? She was just here!","source_cn":"哪去了？怎么会不见了！","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"Kind Priestess","source":"好心的祭司","status":"exact_hash"}}},"faction_dailies/menus/14010536_1_5.en.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010536:1:5","lang":"en","texts":{"menu:8019750:1":{"text":"Fair prices, satisfaction guaranteed.","source_cn":"价格公道，包您满意。","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:精明的食品商人":{"text":"Shrewd Merchant","source":"精明的食品商人","status":"exact_hash"}}},"faction_dailies/menus/14010536_1_7.en.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010536:1:7","lang":"en","texts":{"menu:8019740:2":{"text":"You bought all this bread with just that pouch?!","source_cn":"这么多面包！都是那些钱换来的吗！","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"Kind Priestess","source":"好心的祭司","status":"exact_hash"}}},"faction_dailies/menus/14010536_1_8.en.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010536:1:8","lang":"en","texts":{"menu:8019760:1":{"text":"Mmm... smells sweet. What is that?","source_cn":"香香的甜甜的！是什么味道……","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:瑟缩的平民小孩":{"text":"Frightened Girl","source":"瑟缩的平民小孩","status":"exact_hash"}}},"faction_dailies/menus/14010536_1_9.en.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010536:1:9","lang":"en","texts":{"menu:8019770:1":{"text":"I'm so hungry... I'm starting to see stars...","source_cn":"好饿……天上有星星……","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:饥饿的平民小孩":{"text":"Hungry Boy","source":"饥饿的平民小孩","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234440.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234440","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234440","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423444001:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, a priestess came to me yesterday. Looks like she ran into trouble.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE089E893CD047783","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, a priestess came to me yesterday. Looks like she ran into trouble.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, a priestess came to me yesterday. Looks like she ran into trouble.","variant_male_record_index":"171941","variant_female_record_index":"171942","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423444002:1":{"text":"She said she was trying to help feed the hungry, but something must have gone wrong...","source_cn":"祭司提到她在救助饥饿的平民，或许是救助过程不顺……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B083B2FC0AD4682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423444003:1":{"text":"Could you head over to the <style=\"highlight\">Goodwill Market</style> and check on her for me?","source_cn":"总之，你能代我去<style=highlight>蒙惠...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB4179D5E5BF21AD5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Could you head over to the <style=\"highlight\">Goodwill Market</style> and check on her for me?","female":"Could you head over to the <style=\"highlight\">Goodwill Market</style> and check on her for me?","variant_male_record_index":"171944","variant_female_record_index":"171945","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"Ravion","source":"沙利叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234450.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234450","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234450","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1423445001:0":{"text":"That must be her!","source_cn":"就是这位祭司吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B4536CC318B7C05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234460.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234460","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1423446001:1":{"text":"Are you the priestess helping the commoners? Ravion sent us. Anything we can do?","source_cn":"你就是那位想要救助平民的祭司吗？沙利叶让我们来问问你有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1153723E1DC04801","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423446002:1":{"text":"Thank goodness you're here! I can't find my coin pouch... it had all the money I saved to buy food for the kids in the commoners' district!","source_cn":"你们来得正好！我的钱袋不见了……那是我给平民区孩子们买...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F4E25810227A26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423446003:1":{"text":"Can you help me look for it? My bag is kind of a mess... sorry about that.","source_cn":"能帮我找找我的钱袋吗？包里有点乱，请不要介意……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB948841748DC943F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"Kind Priestess","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234470.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234470","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234470","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1423447001:0":{"text":"You found it! Thank you so much!","source_cn":"谢谢你们帮我找到钱袋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65C71D9373615C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423447002:0":{"text":"Let's get some food for the kids!","source_cn":"我们去给孩子们买点吃的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB586684E82D09BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"Kind Priestess","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234480.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234480","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234480","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1423448001:1":{"text":"I want to get food the kids will like... I'll buy as much as this money can get!","source_cn":"我想买点孩子们爱吃的食物……这些钱能买多少我就买多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CA799C0932FF7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423448002:1":{"text":"Hate to break it to you, but that's barely enough for two loaves of bread.","source_cn":"啧啧，恕我直言，您这些钱可买不了多少，顶多只能买两块面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE14410FC8C90B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423448003:1":{"text":"Things aren't like they used to be. Prices in the royal city are through the roof!","source_cn":"世道不比以前了，现在王城里什么东西的价格不是飞涨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7008FEF05976EF41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423448004:1":{"text":"Two loaves won't be enough... there are so many mouths to feed...","source_cn":"可是两块根本不够……那么多孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47708CF89BA5723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423448005:1":{"text":"I remember the bread from Brimstone Village—it's bigger, tastier, and a lot cheaper too...","source_cn":"我记得深岩村出产的面包个头又大又美味，比这里要实惠得多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E75AE7E47944842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423448006:1":{"text":"We can go ask around in Brimstone Village for you. Their bread should be more affordable!","source_cn":"祭司小姐，我们可以帮你去深岩村问问！那里的面包应该会便...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC3E9ACDBE3F1BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423448007:1":{"text":"Thank you! I'll leave the pouch with you. Please bring back as much as you can.","source_cn":"谢谢你们！钱袋就交给你们了，多带些面包回来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD454DF30A6F1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"Kind Priestess","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:精明的食品商人":{"text":"Shrewd Merchant","source":"精明的食品商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234490.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234490","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234490","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1423449001:1":{"text":"Hi there, we'd like to buy some bread... How much can we get with this?","source_cn":"您好，我们想买些面包……这些钱够买多少呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA869D48371C5B137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423449002:1":{"text":"Wow! That's enough to buy out my entire stock!","source_cn":"这！这都够把我手头的面包都买下来了！大主顾啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0610FB5F2FF46CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423449003:1":{"text":"Let me pack that up for you. Hope to see you again soon!","source_cn":"我给您把面包装起来，欢迎您下次再来！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCDFC206EA953CC0F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let me pack that up for you. Hope to see you again soon!","female":"Let me pack that up for you. Hope to see you again soon!","variant_male_record_index":"171961","variant_female_record_index":"171962","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:矮人巴尔姆":{"text":"Barmel","source":"矮人巴尔姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234500.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234500","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234500","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423450001:1":{"text":"Wow! You brought so much back. The kids can finally have a proper meal.","source_cn":"哇！你们带回了这么多面包！孩子们能吃顿饱饭了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF260CC8A16E1DF38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423450002:1":{"text":"Come on, let's go hand it out!","source_cn":"我们去把面包带给孩子们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3920EB9ACE1C46E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"Kind Priestess","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234510.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234510","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234510","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1423451001:1":{"text":"Miss, what is this? It smells so good... and sweet!","source_cn":"姐姐，这是什么……闻起来很香，很甜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65CB2EFB0A98AD27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423451002:1":{"text":"It's called bread. It's yours. Take your time and enjoy it.","source_cn":"这叫面包！是给你的，慢慢吃吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB5DEB9F75020A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瑟缩的平民小孩":{"text":"Frightened Girl","source":"瑟缩的平民小孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"Kind Priestess","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234520.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234520","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234520","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1423452001:1":{"text":"Eat this. You'll feel better with something in your stomach!","source_cn":"吃点面包吧！这样才会有力气！","status":"matched","hash_